ival mode with random waves!<br></li><li>Item enchantments like runes and gems!<br></li><li>Unique hero skills.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/566430/extras/79207c0be8cc7b7bfbbb3fec28ebbaf3.avif?t=1542170441\" width=620 height=620 /></span>",
